  "http.urlDataGuard": { type: "'off' | 'data' | 'strict'", description: "Ask before an address sends data in web fetch, the initial crawl URL, HTTP GET, browser navigation, supported shell clients, and literal MCP URL arguments (ATO-1377). `\"data\"` (default) checks for substantial or encoded data. `\"strict\"` also asks on the first visit per site per chat. `\"off\"` disables these URL prompts." },
